    final (yaml, workflowFile) = entry.value;
    final ref = pinnedRef(yaml, workflowFile)!;
    expect(yaml.contains('factory_ref: $ref'), isTrue,
        reason: '${entry.key}: factory_ref must repeat the uses-ref literally');
  }
});
```

…and either iterate `stubs` in the lockstep test or correct its doc to name the two checks that actually use it. Drop the `? ref : ref` ternary (return `ref`).
